4,0,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf together. Should we focus on logic, or do you think intuition is more important here?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Logic is the only reliable tool we have. Intuition is just a fancy word for guessing, and guessing leads to mistakes. Let's keep our observations objective and avoid emotional conclusions.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shion. Intuition is too volatile for a game of deduction. We should focus on analyzing the patterns of speech and looking for logical contradictions in our claims as the game progresses.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,"While logic is a sturdy staff to lean on, let us not forget that the human heart often speaks truths that words cannot. A balance of both will guide us most surely toward the light.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so happy to be playing with everyone! I think Servas is right—a little bit of both sounds perfect. Let's just make sure we all stay friendly and support each other while we play!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"That sounds like a great plan! I'll try my best to be helpful. @Shion and @Ryuji, I'll keep a close eye on the logic, but I hope we can still have fun while we do it!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Fun is a byproduct of a well-executed strategy, Kenji. If we prioritize the correct process, the result will be satisfying. Let's focus on establishing a clear framework for how we'll evaluate claims starting tomorrow.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,A framework is a good idea. We should document who claims what and cross-reference those statements. Any deviation from a player's established logic or a sudden change in their stance should be flagged as a potential red flag.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. While a framework provides structure, let us remain open to the unexpected. A rigid mind can sometimes miss the subtle truth hidden in a simple gesture or a soft word.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"I agree! Let's not be too strict with each other. If we're too focused on ""red flags,"" we might accidentally hurt someone's feelings. Let's just trust each other and keep the positive vibes going!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I get what you mean, Yumi! We definitely shouldn't be mean. But if we find a contradiction, we have to talk about it, right? I'm curious to see how everyone's logic holds up tomorrow!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Of course. Contradictions are the only objective evidence we can rely on. If someone's story shifts, it's not a matter of being ""mean"" to point it out; it's a matter of survival for the village.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly. Survival depends on accuracy, not politeness. We must separate the person from the statement. If a claim is logically unsound, it must be challenged regardless of the social atmosphere. That is the most efficient way to find the werewolf.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"True, Ryuji, but remember that the spirit in which we challenge one another matters. Let us seek the truth with kindness and a steady heart, for unity is our greatest strength against the darkness.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"That's such a lovely way to put it, Servas! I totally agree that unity is important. Let's all try to be kind to one another, even when we're disagreeing. I'm sure we can find the werewolf together!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm totally on board with that! Let's combine Shion and Ryuji's logic with Servas and Yumi's kindness. I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow! Good luck everyone, let's do our best!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Ryuji"",""Servas"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shion,,"I've said all that needs to be said for today. Let's see if everyone can actually maintain that ""balance"" when the pressure starts tomorrow. I'll be watching closely.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I have no further additions. I will spend the night reviewing our initial positions and preparing to analyze the information provided tomorrow. I am ready.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Servas,,"May we all find peace in the coming night. Let us enter tomorrow with clear minds and open hearts, ready to support one another in our search for the truth. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! I hope you all have sweet dreams. I'm really looking forward to tomorrow—let's all do our best and keep smiling! See you in the morning!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
